    "title": "Cebu-Born DJ Gudfella to Perform at Coachella 2026 Weekend 2 - Coachella Today",
    "text": "Got story updates? Submit your updates here. ›The vibrant energy and cutting-edge sounds of the Do LaB stage at Coachella 2026 will shine through in the festival's lineup, including a performance by rising Cebu-born DJ Gudfella.Coachella TodayKyle Domingo, a Cebu-born and LA-based DJ and producer known as Gudfella, is set to perform at Coachella 2026 Weekend 2 as part of the Do LaB lineup. Domingo has over 1.5 million monthly listeners and is poised to redefine the house music scene at the festival. Why it matters Coachella is one of the most prestigious and influential music festivals in the world, and the Do LaB stage is known for featuring cutting-edge electronic and dance acts. Domingo's inclusion in the lineup is a significant milestone for the Cebu-born artist, showcasing his growing international recognition and the continued globalization of the music industry. The details Domingo, who was born in Cebu, Philippines and is now based in Los Angeles, will be performing at Coachella 2026 Weekend 2, which runs from April 17-19, 2026. The Do LaB stage is known as a \"festival within a festival\" at Coachella, featuring a diverse lineup of electronic, house, and dance music acts. Coachella 2026 Weekend 2 will take place from April 17-19, 2026. The players Kyle DomingoA Cebu-born and LA-based DJ and producer known by his stage name Gudfella, with over 1.5 million monthly listeners on music streaming platforms.Do LaBAn interactive art and music collective that curates a dedicated stage at the Coachella music festival, known for featuring cutting-edge electronic and dance acts. Got photos? Submit your photos here. › What they’re saying “Coachella is a dream gig for any artist, and I'm honored to be part of the Do LaB lineup this year. I can't wait to bring my unique sound and energy to the festival and connect with music fans from around the world.”— Kyle Domingo The takeaway Domingo's inclusion in the Coachella 2026 lineup is a testament to his growing international recognition and the continued globalization of the music industry, as a Cebu-born artist makes his mark on one of the world's most prestigious music festivals.",
